<title>USA: Alex Brown declines comment on stock activity.</title>
<headline>Alex Brown declines comment on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Alex Brown Inc declined to comment after the exchange requested a public statement indicating whether any corporate developments may explain the unusual market activity of Alex Brown's stock.</p>
<p>Alex Brown cited company policy in declining comment, the NYSE said.</p>
<p>The stock closed up 8-1/4 at 52-7/8 Friday.</p>
